  <NAME>Expression profile of Lo19S state cells in the presence and absence of bortezomib treatment</NAME>
  <TITLE>Expression profile of Lo19S state cells in the presence and absence of bortezomib treatment</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We transiently induce the Lo19S state with a dox inducible shRNa targeting PSMD2 and explore the gene expression in the presence and absence of bortezomib Overall design: one cell type (T47D), two states (Control and Lo19S) with and without treatment with 20nM bortezomib , all in triplicates</DESCRIPTION>
